Description: MySQL-compatible distributed relational database (one node, in memory)
 Kvasir is a relational database that speaks the MySQL 8.4 client/server
 protocol and SQL: any MySQL client, driver or tool connects to a node over
 TLS. It is a hosted system on Dannan, the network layer.
 .
 This package holds kvasir-node, one node that keeps its databases in
 memory. It keeps nothing on disk and does not yet join other nodes, so it
 starts only at the ephemeral acknowledgement level: a committed transaction
 is lost when the node stops. Its systemd unit is installed disabled.
